MODULE 7 — SMART APPLY ASSISTANCE

Instructions:
This module only activates for company career website apply flows (not LinkedIn, Naukri, Indeed — 
those have their own apply systems).

Step 1 — Detect Apply Button:
  * On the job's career page, scan for buttons or links containing text such as:
    "Apply", "Apply Now", "Apply for this role", "Submit application", "Click here to apply",
    "Start application", "Apply online"
  * Support both button elements and anchor links
  * If multiple apply options exist, list them and ask user which to use

Step 2 — Confirm Before Proceeding:
  * Show a confirmation dialog: 
    "I found an Apply button for [Job Title] at [Company]. Shall I start filling the application 
    form using your resume data? You will review and approve everything before submission."
  * Do NOT proceed unless user explicitly says Yes / Confirm / Proceed

Step 3 — Form Detection and Autofill:
  * Detect all form fields on the application page
  * Map resume data to form fields:
    - Name fields → parsed full name
    - Email → resume email
    - Phone → resume phone
    - LinkedIn URL → resume LinkedIn
    - Resume upload field → prompt user to confirm upload of parsed file
    - Cover letter → offer to generate a tailored cover letter using AI
    - Work experience fields → map from parsed experience history
    - Education → map from parsed education
    - Skills → match to their dropdown options or free-text fields
    - Location → map from resume or user's preferred location
    - Notice period → ask user for current notice period before filling
    - Current CTC / Expected CTC → ask user before filling (do NOT guess salary)
    - Referral code → leave blank unless user provides one

Step 4 — Review Before Submit:
  * Display a full preview of every filled field
  * Highlight any fields left blank or uncertain (shown in orange)
  * Allow user to edit any field before submission
  * Show a checklist: all required fields completed? attachments uploaded?

Step 5 — Final Submit Gate:
  * Show a final confirmation message: 
    "All fields are filled and reviewed. Do you want to submit this application to [Company] 
    for [Job Title]? This action cannot be undone."
  * Only submit after explicit "Yes, submit" from user
  * Never auto-submit under any circumstance
  * After submission, log the application: Company, Role, Date, Status = "Applied"

Step 6 — Safety Rules (Non-Negotiable):
  * Never bypass CAPTCHA — if CAPTCHA appears, pause and inform user: 
    "A CAPTCHA has appeared. Please complete it manually and then confirm to continue."
  * Never bypass OTP or 2-factor authentication — pause and wait for user
  * Never create accounts on behalf of the user
  * Never store passwords
  * Never submit to more than one company at a time
  * Log every action taken for user's review

